// inst_piano — Grand Piano (Salamander Grand Piano V3, Yamaha C5; giữ stretch tuning gốc)
// Salamander Grand Piano V3 by Alexander Holm, CC BY 3.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/); source archive.org/details/SalamanderGrandPianoV3 via github.com/sfzinstruments/SalamanderGrandPiano. Modified (see content/LICENSES/).
// Rút gọn bằng engine/tools/le-import-library (agent 80, render/SampleImport.cpp): chọn phím gốc ≥ 3 nửa cung (zone đầu / cuối phủ tới phím 0 / 127), 3 lớp velocity, cắt đầu, cắt đuôi + fade, mono, FLAC 24-bit, giữ cao độ gốc (tune 0), volume = cân loudness.
